{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented Turn 1 with zero npm dependencies. Holds block overlapping bookings in the same room until their expiration minute. Confirming a live hold clears its expiration and keeps the slot reserved. Back-to-back bookings are allowed.\n\nPricing now accepts any positive whole-minute duration and rounds the subtotal half-up to integer cents before calculating tax. All three requested helpers are exported from `src/index.ts`.\n\nAdded six tests covering pricing, overlap, expiration, confirmation, and validation. `node benchmarks/sources/ev2_ts_bookings/run_checks.mjs` exited 0 with all 9 tests passing."}}
